  "shortDescription": "Microsoft Teams is scored here as a team-messaging and collaboration hub, not as a peer cloud-phone product. Free Teams and Microsoft 365 Plans include chat and meetings; Teams Phone Standard (~$10/user/month annual) plus PSTN (PAYG ~$13 / Calling Plan ~$17 / Domestic+International ~$34) is a telephony add-on that also requires an eligible Teams/M365 licence. October 2023 Teams unbundling means Teams is no longer assumed free inside every Microsoft 365 SKU — verify licence packaging.",
